{"logId": "86a2ee1d-612a-4d26-becf-528e7f7bc053", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [843, 135, 1083, 251], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[843.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 251.0], [843.0, 251.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "让每一个来胖东来的人都感觉是到了自己的家中，“宾至如归”在这里得到了最形象的诠释。", "block_bbox": [199, 228, 918, 289], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 228.0], [918.0, 228.0], [918.0, 289.0], [199.0, 289.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "商场员工一家亲", "block_bbox": [240, 299, 396, 325], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 299.0], [396.0, 299.0], [396.0, 325.0], [240.0, 325.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "工作量这么大，胖东来百货却很少有员工抱屈的，他们缘何会有这么大的工作热情呢？胖东来电影厅的杨晓红用亲身经历说出了个中原因。", "block_bbox": [198, 334, 976, 394], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 334.0], [976.0, 334.0], [976.0, 394.0], [198.0, 394.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "新员工坐上公司专车", "block_bbox": [239, 403, 439, 429], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 403.0], [439.0, 403.0], [439.0, 429.0], [239.0, 429.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "有一件事让杨晓红至今感动不已。那是在军训期间，胖东来百货组织全体新员工在市体育馆进行经营理念培训时，她的脚不小心被崴住了，疼痛不已。当她一瘸一拐地走出体育馆时，被胖东来商贸集团有限公司董事长于东来看到了，他迅速走过去嘘寒问暖。了解到情况后，他让司机到马路对面买来可口的饭菜，并送她回家。杨晓红坐在董事长的专车内，于东来关切地对她说：“我送你几张讲解咱们企业理念的光盘，这几天你就不必来培训了，在家认真看也能取得相同的效果！”第二天，杨晓红觉得自己在家里看光盘不过瘾，就强忍着疼痛坐公交车赶来听课，结果又被于东来看到了。于东来“批评”了她几句，并再次让他的司机开着他的专车把她送回了家。", "block_bbox": [197, 439, 976, 709], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 439.0], [976.0, 439.0], [976.0, 709.0], [197.0, 709.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "杨晓红动情地说：“我在商海闯荡了这么多年，还没有见过这样关心员工的企业老板，跟着这样的老板干，再苦再累，我也觉得值！”", "block_bbox": [198, 717, 976, 777], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 717.0], [976.0, 717.0], [976.0, 777.0], [198.0, 777.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "来的都是客", "block_bbox": [239, 787, 355, 813], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 787.0], [355.0, 787.0], [355.0, 813.0], [239.0, 813.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "胖东来百货电影厅的吴承梅则给记者讲述了这样一件事：下午，电影厅正在放《无极》，靠后的座位上大约有二三十名观众，东来哥（这是胖东来百货工作人员挂在嘴边的一个称谓，记者注）领着几名贵宾走了进来。当我从前台拿饮料给客人饮用时，东来哥小声对我说“请到前台再拿一些饮料，给每个观众发一瓶，到这儿来的都是咱们的客人”。观众们听说是胖东来的老总在请大家免费喝饮料，感动得连声说“谢谢”。看到东来哥不但对我们十分关心，而且对顾客也这么好时，我的心里顿时暖洋洋的。", "block_bbox": [194, 823, 750, 1128], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[194.0, 823.0], [750.0, 823.0], [750.0, 1128.0], [194.0, 1128.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [740, 861, 977, 1140], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[740.0, 861.0], [977.0, 861.0], [977.0, 1140.0], [740.0, 1140.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "给员工送情人节礼物", "block_bbox": [238, 1136, 438, 1162], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1136.0], [438.0, 1136.0], [438.0, 1162.0], [238.0, 1162.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "和杨晓红、吴承梅有同样感动的，相信胖东来百货的每个员工都经历过。今年情人节那一天，胖东来百货的每一名员工都收到了于东来送给大家的特殊礼物：一枝玫瑰花，一", "block_bbox": [198, 1171, 976, 1231], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 1171.0], [976.0, 1171.0], [976.0, 1231.0], [198.0, 1231.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [999, 609, 1137, 725], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[999.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [999.0, 725.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7581961750984192, "coordinate": [843, 135, 1083, 251], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[843.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 251.0], [843.0, 251.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8770713806152344, "coordinate": [199, 228, 918, 289], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 228.0], [918.0, 228.0], [918.0, 289.0], [199.0, 289.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8391323685646057, "coordinate": [240, 299, 396, 325], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 299.0], [396.0, 299.0], [396.0, 325.0], [240.0, 325.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9064429998397827, "coordinate": [198, 334, 976, 394], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 334.0], [976.0, 334.0], [976.0, 394.0], [198.0, 394.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8489715456962585, "coordinate": [239, 403, 439, 429], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 403.0], [439.0, 403.0], [439.0, 429.0], [239.0, 429.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9616759419441223, "coordinate": [197, 439, 976, 709], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 439.0], [976.0, 439.0], [976.0, 709.0], [197.0, 709.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9024423956871033, "coordinate": [198, 717, 976, 777], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 717.0], [976.0, 717.0], [976.0, 777.0], [198.0, 777.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8013561964035034, "coordinate": [239, 787, 355, 813], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 787.0], [355.0, 787.0], [355.0, 813.0], [239.0, 813.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7236983776092529, "coordinate": [194, 823, 750, 1128], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[194.0, 823.0], [750.0, 823.0], [750.0, 1128.0], [194.0, 1128.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.709715723991394, "coordinate": [740, 861, 977, 1140], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[740.0, 861.0], [977.0, 861.0], [977.0, 1140.0], [740.0, 1140.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8558782935142517, "coordinate": [238, 1136, 438, 1162], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 1136.0], [438.0, 1136.0], [438.0, 1162.0], [238.0, 1162.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9169154167175293, "coordinate": [198, 1171, 976, 1231], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 1171.0], [976.0, 1171.0], [976.0, 1231.0], [198.0, 1231.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5045372247695923, "coordinate": [999, 609, 1137, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[999.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [999.0, 725.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "让每一个来胖东来的人都感觉是到了自己的家中，“宾至如归”在这里得到了最形象的诠释。\n\n## 商场员工一家亲\n\n工作量这么大，胖东来百货却很少有员工抱屈的，他们缘何会有这么大的工作热情呢？胖东来电影厅的杨晓红用亲身经历说出了个中原因。\n\n## 新员工坐上公司专车\n\n有一件事让杨晓红至今感动不已。那是在军训期间，胖东来百货组织全体新员工在市体育馆进行经营理念培训时，她的脚不小心被崴住了，疼痛不已。当她一瘸一拐地走出体育馆时，被胖东来商贸集团有限公司董事长于东来看到了，他迅速走过去嘘寒问暖。了解到情况后，他让司机到马路对面买来可口的饭菜，并送她回家。杨晓红坐在董事长的专车内，于东来关切地对她说：“我送你几张讲解咱们企业理念的光盘，这几天你就不必来培训了，在家认真看也能取得相同的效果！”第二天，杨晓红觉得自己在家里看光盘不过瘾，就强忍着疼痛坐公交车赶来听课，结果又被于东来看到了。于东来“批评”了她几句，并再次让他的司机开着他的专车把她送回了家。\n\n杨晓红动情地说：“我在商海闯荡了这么多年，还没有见过这样关心员工的企业老板，跟着这样的老板干，再苦再累，我也觉得值！”\n\n## 来的都是客\n\n胖东来百货电影厅的吴承梅则给记者讲述了这样一件事：下午，电影厅正在放《无极》，靠后的座位上大约有二三十名观众，东来哥（这是胖东来百货工作人员挂在嘴边的一个称谓，记者注）领着几名贵宾走了进来。当我从前台拿饮料给客人饮用时，东来哥小声对我说“请到前台再拿一些饮料，给每个观众发一瓶，到这儿来的都是咱们的客人”。观众们听说是胖东来的老总在请大家免费喝饮料，感动得连声说“谢谢”。看到东来哥不但对我们十分关心，而且对顾客也这么好时，我的心里顿时暖洋洋的。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_740_861_977_1140.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"19%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 给员工送情人节礼物\n\n和杨晓红、吴承梅有同样感动的，相信胖东来百货的每个员工都经历过。今年情人节那一天，胖东来百货的每一名员工都收到了于东来送给大家的特殊礼物：一枝玫瑰花，一\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_999_609_1137_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_843_135_1083_251.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//86a2ee1d-612a-4d26-becf-528e7f7bc053/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_843_135_1083_251.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe3ef4e6a27defc6bbaaaf9bc23ce0b19705ba832eef451bedee44a5b6cf5616f", "imgs/img_in_image_box_740_861_977_1140.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//86a2ee1d-612a-4d26-becf-528e7f7bc053/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_740_861_977_1140.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2F5af47d7a204290fd42a056fb728f0a591c84edb510f2f04eab6f5610ac49ba40", "imgs/img_in_image_box_999_609_1137_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//86a2ee1d-612a-4d26-becf-528e7f7bc053/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_999_609_1137_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa555d69d2be597a77fa295aadd002901db8809687107ed9dd3b75c8ae69d8bd0"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//86a2ee1d-612a-4d26-becf-528e7f7bc053/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2F37e9a21f81d3427ad1d8cca6dc6dc6329bd5871dfc4f32ee9249fd372d4c6a9a"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//86a2ee1d-612a-4d26-becf-528e7f7bc053/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2F3d0e7b68e7d4a407abeaf4288583744eb2653214fd128e969b9586404608e66c"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["